.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
oci data\-science job create\-job\-artifact [OPTIONS]
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SS Required Parameters
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-job\-artifact\-file [text]
.UNINDENT
