.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-project\-id [text]
.UNINDENT
.sp
<b>Filter</b> results by the \fI\%OCID\fP <\fBhttps://docs.cloud.oracle.com/iaas/Content/General/Concepts/identifiers.htm\fP> of the project.
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-sort\-by [text]
.UNINDENT
.sp
Specifies the field to sort by. Accepts only one field. By default, when you sort by \fItimeCreated\fP, results are shown in descending order. When you sort by \fIdisplayName\fP, results are shown in ascending order. Sort order for the \fIdisplayName\fP field is case sensitive.
.sp
Accepted values are:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
displayName, timeCreated
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-sort\-order [text]
.UNINDENT
.sp
Specifies sort order to use, either \fIASC\fP (ascending) or \fIDESC\fP (descending).
.sp
Accepted values are:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
ASC, DESC
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
