\fI\%Example using required parameter\fP
.UNINDENT
.SS Description
.sp
Updates the properties of a model deployment. Some of the properties of \fImodelDeploymentConfigurationDetails\fP or \fICategoryLogDetails\fP can also be updated with zero down time when the model deployment’s lifecycle state is ACTIVE or NEEDS_ATTENTION i.e \fIinstanceShapeName\fP, \fIinstanceCount\fP and \fImodelId\fP, separately \fIloadBalancerShape\fP or \fICategoryLogDetails\fP can also be updated independently. All of the fields can be updated when the deployment is in the INACTIVE lifecycle state. Changes will take effect the next time the model deployment is activated.
.SS Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
oci data\-science model\-deployment update [OPTIONS]
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
